{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1315002441406,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "One RCT allocated 20 infants with NEC to receive ampicillin and gentamicin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0528869628906,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "versus IV ampicillin and gentamicin with oral gentamicin for 4 days [Hansen, 1987].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0328369140625,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "In this study, enrolled infants were more mature (ampicillin and gentamicin 34.7±1.3",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0927429199219,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "weeks gestation and ampicillin and gentamicin with oral gentamicin 35.6±1.1 weeks)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1027526855469,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "and higher birth weight (ampicillin and gentamicin 2220±295g and ampicillin and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0828552246094,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "gentamicin with oral gentamicin 2180±198g) than many studies reporting NEC.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.61207580566406,
        399.1326904296875,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "p This study found no significant differences in outcomes (  > 0.05), including days",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.0828552246094,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "with peritonitis, days with pneumatosis, major complications including perforation,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.0927429199219,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "stricture and ileus, and death. This study was underpowered to detect most",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.05279541015625,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "differences, with blinding and allocation concealment not well defined. The quality",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        196.60292053222656,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "of this evidence was graded as low.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        214.2606964111328,
        163.96287536621094,
        226.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "5.7.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        242.04539489746094
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.91539001464844,
        399.1228942871094,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Vancomycin and ceftriaxone may be better than ampicillin and gentamicin for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.91539001464844,
        399.1128845214844,
        269.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of NEC but the confidence in this statement is low, because factors other",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.9153747558594,
        399.1127624511719,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "than antibiotics may have resulted in or contributed to the beneficial effect as the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.10284423828125,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "study was a non-concurrent study. There is no evidence to judge the benefits of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.9153747558594,
        120.22291564941406,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "metronidazole.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        328.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        329.4192810058594,
        399.0829162597656,
        342.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Clindamycin was administered in one study to cover gram negative organisms and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        342.4192810058594,
        399.05291748046875,
        355.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "resulted in a significantly higher rate of stricture formation. There is no evidence to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        355.4192810058594,
        191.5429229736328,
        368.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "judge the risks of metronidazole.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        379.9378967285156,
        205.30300903320312,
        391.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "5.7.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        395.5924987792969,
        399.0628662109375,
        409.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "A combination of vancomycin and ceftriaxone may not be feasible and may be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        408.5924987792969,
        345.1928405761719,
        422.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "expensive to use as a first line antibiotic treatment in infants with NEC.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.1401062011719,
        195.8759002685547,
        445.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "5.8\t Kangaroo Mother Care",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        448.76580810546875,
        399.09295654296875,
        462.2558288574219
      ],
      "text": "Low birth weight (LBW) neonates weighing < 2000 g who are clinically stable should",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        461.76580810546875,
        351.68292236328125,
        475.2558288574219
      ],
      "text": "be provided Kangaroo Mother Care (KMC) early in the first week of life.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        477.17041015625,
        277.7628173828125,
        491.0904235839844
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        493.43499755859375,
        399.1128845214844,
        506.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that although there is no evidence for KMC in babies > 2000 g,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        506.43499755859375,
        399.09283447265625,
        519.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "KMC may be beneficial in neonates who have temperature instability. However,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        519.4349975585938,
        328.27294921875,
        532.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "implementation will require a description on how to provide KMC.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        543.9535522460938,
        275.3829040527344,
        555.943603515625
      ],
      "text": "5.8.1\t Evidence and summary of recommendations",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        559.6082763671875,
        399.0927734375,
        573.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "We identified one recent systematic review [Lawn, 2010] which aimed to assess the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        572.6082763671875,
        399.0528869628906,
        586.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "effect on neonatal mortality and morbidity from complications of preterm birth of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        585.6082763671875,
        399.072998046875,
        599.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "KMC compared to no care at all or compared to conventional care. A preterm death",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        598.6082763671875,
        399.0226135253906,
        612.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "was defined as a neonatal death in a baby with a birth weight < 2000 g. KMC was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.40969848632812,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6356964111328,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "32",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}